WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.067
To round, find the target place and inspect the digit immediately to its right. Five

00:00:05.067 --> 00:00:06.365
or more rounds up.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:15.769
Round 87,600 to the nearest 10. The answer is 87,600. Check the next digit and round

00:00:15.769 --> 00:00:17.376
87,600 to 87,600.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:25.099
A crowd estimate at a science exhibition is based on 54,130 visitors. To the nearest

00:00:25.099 --> 00:00:29.699
1,000, what should be reported? Pause to choose and explain.

00:00:30.533 --> 00:00:38.688
A crowd estimate at a science exhibition is based on 54,130 visitors. To the nearest

00:00:38.688 --> 00:00:46.844
1,000, what should be reported? The answer is 54,000. Check the next digit and round

00:00:46.844 --> 00:00:48.475
54,130 to 54,000.
